    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Love, Elections, and Chocolate</i> is a romantic visual novel developed by the Japanese game studio Sprite. Upon its release in Japan, it garnered numerous awards for its exceptional art, captivating music, and well-crafted characters.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0<strong><u>Story</u></strong> <br><br><strong>Sappy romantic Oojima Yuuki and notorious chocolate-hater Sumiyoshi Chisato are longtime friends who both attend Takafuji Academy, a massive mega-school with over 5,000 students.<br><br> The two are part of the Culinary Research Club\u2014which sounds cool on paper, but in actuality,\u00a0is just an excuse to sit around and eat junk food with their friends. <br>As the Student Council presidential election approaches, however, the CRC is targeted for termination by a prominent candidate named Shinonome Satsuki.<br><br>Their only option: Join the election and keep her from winning at any cost!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0<u><strong>Characters</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027600/extras/7cfe924b3e6727287c6bb5198017bb30.avif?t=1743155986\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>President of the Culinary Research Club and childhood friend to Yuuki. <br>Smart and athletic with an overbearing personality, she has publicly declared Yuuki to be her property. <br>Notoriously hates chocolate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027600/extras/dc5ffd84c103a0d5ac3ad437bfe68089.avif?t=1743155986\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hard-working optimist who attends Takafuji through its Financial Aid program while looking after her two younger brothers. <br>Her smile is contagious.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027600/extras/1c6a187c0c241f9d549295d215064afb.avif?t=1743155986\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The newest member of the Culinary Research Club. <br>Quiet and aloof like a cat, she often keeps to herself. <br>Her catchphrase is &quot;Meh.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027600/extras/63604caf4792100b98116f4425c3688d.avif?t=1743155986\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A delicate girl who was held back a year due to illness. <br>While her sense of humor borders on esoteric, she wants nothing but the best for her bestie Chisato.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027600/extras/0602837200d711ffc03199509db09a7c.avif?t=1743155986\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Head Treasurer and favored candidate to win the upcoming election. <br>Her beauty is surpassed only by her analytical mind... and her sweet tooth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027600/extras/d7064a3f11456120efab006fc9925297.avif?t=1743155986\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Former president of the Culinary Research Club and a brilliant inventor of wacky gadgets. Yuuki's signature roll cake is her favorite food.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027600/extras/95f74f6bc1f72e6fabdcd32db8944b24.avif?t=1743155986\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vice president of the Culinary Research Club whose family operates a major snack food manufacturer. <br>He may seem polite and docile, but he's mastered the art of innuendo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027600/extras/9d1d510863b97fc24f82fb773507c111.avif?t=1743155986\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bratty and shallow, but call her a &quot;monkey&quot; at your own peril! <br>Her family runs a fishmonger's shop. <br>Rarely seen without her childhood friend Ai.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027600/extras/403d30aaa78d5bc51018c8a9214cec8c.avif?t=1743155986\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advisor to the Culinary Research Club and older sister to Satsuki. <br>She has a bad habit of getting drunk and causing trouble.</strong></p>",
